<section id="server-type-exchange-ews">
<title>Exchange EWS</title>
<p>Para conectar a un servidor de Microsoft Exchange (2007 y superior) o un servidor OpenChange, se recomienda usar el paquete <sys>evolution-ews</sys>.</p>
<note style="info package">
  <p>Esto requiere tener instalado el paquete <sys>evolution-ews</sys>.</p>
  <if:choose>
    <if:when test="action:install">
      <p><link action="install:evolution-ews" href="https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/evolution/-/wikis/home#get-the-source-code" style="button">Install evolution-ews</link></p>
